          "AffiliationInfo": {"Affiliation": "School of Nursing, Institute for Research on Women and Gender, Department of Obstetrics and Gynecology, and Department of Women's Studies, University of Michigan, Ann Arbor, Michigan 48109-1290, USA. jseng@umich.edu"}
        }
      },
      "ArticleTitle": "Posttraumatic oxytocin dysregulation: is it a link among posttraumatic self disorders, posttraumatic stress disorder, and pelvic visceral dysregulation conditions in women?",
